    "model_variables_reason": "The BoM statistical downscaling (BOM, BOM-SDM, domain AUS) gives pr in mm (daily datasets) and mm/month (monthly datasets), a different use of the variable: each is a variable of its own, variables/cordex/<model>/<variable>/<units>, member of the CORDEX variables and of the variables of the model (variables/cordex/<model>, associated with the model), derived from the MIP variable. Also the fractions in 1 instead of % (hurs of NUIM WRF341E, hur200, hur500, hur850 and sic of UCAN WRF341I, sftlf of DMI HIRHAM5), and snw in m (snow depth as liquid water) and mrso in m3/m3 (volumetric soil moisture) of CSIRO CCAM, taken as legitimate alternative units or measures of the same phenomena (not checked in the NetCDF files). The relation to the MIP variable is linear_transformation (data:isLinearTransformationOf) if the units are convertible (1 and %; m of liquid water and kg m-2, assuming the density of water), derived (data:derivedFromVariable) for a different quantity (pr totals in mm and mm/month; the sea ice flag of WRF341I, sea_ice_flag, from the sea ice fraction), and none if neither (mrso in m3/m3 needs the soil depth).",
