    "variables_from_id_reason": "The facet variable of some datasets does not list the variable of the dataset, which is the variable of their id (its last component): the RU-CORE RegCM4-3 datasets (SEA-22) of sfcWind (9) list only crs (the grid mapping), and those of mrsol (9) only crs, soil_bounds and soil_layer (coordinates), with their metadata; the UCAN WRF341I datasets (SAM-44) of the variables at a single pressure level (hus200, ta500, zg850, ..., 27) list the variable of all the levels (hus, ta, zg, ...), with the metadata of the dataset. The datasets matching a rule get the variable of the id in place of the facet variable, before the other rules are applied; facet_metadata tells whether the metadata of the facets (variable_units, cf_standard_name, variable_long_name) are those of the variable of the dataset (if not, they are dropped)."
